        "title": "Reading note",
        "html": "<p>Sections 2 and 3 use LangSmith&#39;s cloud interface for course review. Entry points were checked against official documentation available on October 30, 2026, but the full exercise has not been run in a signed-in account. Demonstration answers are illustrative, not measured results.</p>"
